## src/main.zag — binary entry point for cfgtool.
##
## Stands alone in the fixture: the worked example imports
## `internal_tls` here, but the current compiler does not yet plumb
## `path = "..."` deps through the import resolver (that work ships
## alongside the v0.1 dep CLI). Until then, the fixture's main.zag
## is intentionally dep-free so `examples/run_all.sh` keeps passing.
##
## The metafiles (zag.toml + zag.lock) carry the project-layout
## story; the .zag source stays trivially runnable.

fun main() {
    print("cfgtool v0.1.0\n");
}
